{
  "file": "module5",
  "page": 67,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        64.59669494628906,
        527.4075927734375,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "(9) certainty in the evidence)  . This recommendation on the shorter all-oral bedaquiline-containing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        527.5203857421875,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "regimen replaced earlier recommendations on shorter regimens which contained an injectable agent.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.976374626159668,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        527.42578125,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "In a new IPD meta-analysis used as evidence for the 2020 WHO guidelines, bedaquiline use resulted",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        104.19673156738281,
        527.4273071289062,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "(84) in significantly fewer episodes of treatment failure, relapse and death  . At the time, there was",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        120.19074249267578,
        527.277099609375,
        134.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "limited experience in the use of bedaquiline in children aged under 6 years, but experience of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        133.3907012939453,
        527.3781127929688,
        147.8336944580078
      ],
      "text": "its use in adolescents, patients with EPTB disease and people living with HIV was growing. Earlier",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        146.59071350097656,
        527.4486694335938,
        161.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "recommendations on the composition of longer regimens indicated that bedaquiline could also be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        159.7907257080078,
        527.3881225585938,
        174.2337188720703
      ],
      "text": "included in such regimens for patients aged 6–17 years; hence, the all-oral bedaquiline-containing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        172.99073791503906,
        527.3936157226562,
        187.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "regimen was also conditionally recommended for use in eligible children and adolescents aged 6",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        186.1907501220703,
        149.10240173339844,
        200.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "years and above.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        207.71859741210938,
        527.4405517578125,
        222.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "Gap:  The recommendations that apply to children were based on extrapolation of efficacy data in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        221.09474182128906,
        527.4359741210938,
        235.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "adults, in combination with PK and safety data from phase II trials in children aged 6–17 years. However,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.945917129516602,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        234.29469299316406,
        527.4487915039062,
        248.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "a recommendation on the use of bedaquiline in children aged less than 6 years was not possible",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        247.4947052001953,
        527.3773193359375,
        261.9377136230469
      ],
      "text": "in the past, due to a lack of evidence, particularly on PK, safety and tolerability. The medicines that",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        260.6947021484375,
        527.3904418945312,
        275.1377258300781
      ],
      "text": "compose the shorter all-oral bedaquiline-containing regimen have been part of MDR-TB regimens",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        273.89459228515625,
        527.41015625,
        288.3376159667969
      ],
      "text": "for many years, in similar combinations, for both adults and children. The associated adverse drug",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        287.0947265625,
        527.3704833984375,
        301.5377502441406
      ],
      "text": "reactions have been widely described and the drug dosages established. This however did not apply",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        300.294677734375,
        527.4761962890625,
        314.7377014160156
      ],
      "text": "to bedaquiline at the time of the 2019 GDG on DR-TB, and the use of bedaquiline for young children",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.999699592590332,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        313.49468994140625,
        527.4542846679688,
        327.9377136230469
      ],
      "text": "in both shorter and longer regimens was therefore identified as a gap to be addressed as part of the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        326.6947021484375,
        325.3699035644531,
        341.1377258300781
      ],
      "text": "2021 update of the child and adolescent TB guidelines.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        348.2226257324219,
        527.3736572265625,
        362.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "Evidence: To answer the PICO question on the use of bedaquiline in children under the age of 6",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        361.5986022949219,
        527.4299926757812,
        376.0416259765625
      ],
      "text": "years, data from two phase II trials (TMC207-C211 and IMPAACT P1108) were reviewed by the GDG.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        374.7986145019531,
        527.3915405273438,
        389.24163818359375
      ],
      "text": "TMC207-C211 is a phase II, open-label, single-arm study to evaluate the PK, safety, tolerability and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        387.99859619140625,
        527.2695922851562,
        402.4416198730469
      ],
      "text": "anti-mycobacterial activity of bedaquiline in combination with a background regimen of MDR-TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        401.1986083984375,
        527.608154296875,
        415.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "medications for the treatment of children and adolescents 0–17 years of age who have bacteriologically",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        414.39862060546875,
        524.40966796875,
        428.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "confirmed or clinically diagnosed pulmonary and selected forms of extrapulmonary MDR-TB. 32",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        427.5986022949219,
        527.4310302734375,
        442.0416259765625
      ],
      "text": "IMPAACT P1108 is a phase I/II dose finding modified age de-escalation study to evaluate the PK,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        440.7986145019531,
        527.5933227539062,
        455.24163818359375
      ],
      "text": "safety and tolerability, of bedaquiline in combination with optimized individualized MDR-TB regimens",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.98373794555664,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        453.99859619140625,
        524.606689453125,
        468.4416198730469
      ],
      "text": "in HIV-infected and HIV-uninfected children with clinically diagnosed or confirmed pulmonary (intra-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.991347312927246,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        467.1986083984375,
        338.8182067871094,
        481.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "thoracic) and selected forms of extrapulmonary MDR-TB. 33",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        488.9026184082031,
        527.2717895507812,
        503.34564208984375
      ],
      "text": "As data reviewed from TMC207-C211 corresponded to children aged 5–18 years and that from",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        502.10260009765625,
        527.4234008789062,
        516.5455932617188
      ],
      "text": "IMPAACT P1108 included children aged 0–6 years, the review of PK and safety data focused mainly",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        515.302490234375,
        527.3848876953125,
        529.7454833984375
      ],
      "text": "on data from IMPAACT P1108. Although the sample size of the available interim data for review was",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        528.5025634765625,
        527.4521484375,
        542.945556640625
      ],
      "text": "small (N= 12), the GDG concluded that in children 0–6 years of age, cardiac safety signals were not",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        541.7025146484375,
        527.3892822265625,
        556.1455078125
      ],
      "text": "distinct from those reported in adults. Population PK models from both studies suggest that drug",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        554.902587890625,
        527.4387817382812,
        569.3455810546875
      ],
      "text": "exposures observed in adults can be reached in most children receiving bedaquiline, although some",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        568.1026000976562,
        457.58001708984375,
        582.5455932617188
      ],
      "text": "dose modification may be necessary depending on the age and weight of the child.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        589.8065185546875,
        527.39697265625,
        604.24951171875
      ],
      "text": "In addition, data from a paediatric MDR/RR-TB IPD were analysed descriptively (24 231 records from",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        603.0064697265625,
        527.3904418945312,
        617.449462890625
      ],
      "text": "all six WHO regions, the majority from India and South Africa). The search was conducted in April",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        616.20654296875,
        527.4287719726562,
        630.6495361328125
      ],
      "text": "2020. Just under 20 000 of these records were used for a matched analysis of treatment outcomes in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        629.406494140625,
        527.2261962890625,
        643.8494873046875
      ],
      "text": "children being treated for DR-TB. The analysis included 40 children aged below 6 years and 68 children",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.95480728149414,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        642.6065063476562,
        527.4146118164062,
        657.0494995117188
      ],
      "text": "aged 6–12 years who received bedaquiline. In the matched analysis, bedaquiline was significantly",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        655.8065185546875,
        527.6077270507812,
        670.24951171875
      ],
      "text": "associated with shorter treatment duration and a lower adjusted odds ratio of injectable TB drug use.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.991146087646484,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        669.0064697265625,
        527.407958984375,
        683.449462890625
      ],
      "text": "There was no statistically significant difference in successful treatment outcomes between children",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        682.20654296875,
        527.4068603515625,
        696.6495361328125
      ],
      "text": "aged less than 6 years receiving an all-oral bedaquiline-based regimen versus those not receiving",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        708.6371459960938,
        526.60302734375,
        722.341064453125
      ],
      "text": "Pharmacokinetic study to evaluate anti-mycobacterial activity of TMC207 in combination with background regimen (BR) of multidrug  32",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86609649658203,
        721.4371337890625,
        524.39599609375,
        731.9411010742188
      ],
      "text": "resistant tuberculosis (MDR-TB) medications for treatment of children/adolescents pulmonary MDR-TB (https://clinicaltrials.gov/ct2/",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86609649658203,
        731.037109375,
        246.7532196044922,
        741.5410766601562
      ],
      "text": "show/NCT02354014, accessed 21 January 2022).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        740.2718505859375,
        526.7142333984375,
        753.9757690429688
      ],
      "text": "P1108. A Phase I/II, open-label, single arm study to evaluate the pharmacokinetics, safety and tolerability of bedaquiline (BDQ) in  33",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86609649658203,
        753.0718383789062,
        526.7852172851562,
        763.5758056640625
      ],
      "text": "combination with optimized individualized multidrug-resistant tuberculosis (MDR-TB) therapy in HIV-infected and HIV-uninfected",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86609649658203,
        762.6719360351562,
        522.4754638671875,
        773.1759033203125
      ],
      "text": "infants, children and adolescents with MDR-TB disease (https://www.impaactnetwork.org/studies/p1108, accessed 21 January 2022).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        344.452392578125,
        801.0170288085938,
        554.0401611328125,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "5. Treatment of TB disease in children and adolescents 43",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}